    "FIRE A BARRAGE OF ENERGY THAT <style=cIsHealth>HARMS HOSTILE COMBATANTS</style> AND <style=cIsHealing>HEALS FRIENDLY COMBATANTS</style> FOR <style=cIsDamage>5x800%</style>. <style=cIsUtility>HOLD UP TO 3 CHARGES.</style>": "Dispare uma rajada de energia que <style=cIsHealth>CAUSA DANO A INIMIGOS</style> e <style=cIsHealing>CURA ALIADOS</style> em <style=cIsDamage>5x800%</style>. <style=cIsUtility>ATÉ 3 CARGAS.</style>",
